| **1** | **Career Paths & Job Roles**         | Broad appeal; helps students decide on specializations (e.g., Deck Officer, Engineer, Chief Mate).       | Fresh graduates, career changers, students.   | Comparison tables, salary trends, required certs (STCW, OOW, ETOW), job market outlook.           |
